{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10437","headline":"古大梁行 · 高适","name":"古大梁行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古城莽苍饶荆榛，驱马荒城愁杀人。\n魏王宫观尽禾黍，信陵宾客随灰尘。\n忆昨雄都旧朝市，轩车照耀歌钟起。\n军容带甲三十万，国步连营一千里。\n全盛须臾那可论，高台曲池无复存。\n遗墟但见狐狸迹，古地空余草木根。\n暮天摇落伤怀抱，倚劒悲歌对秋草。\n侠客犹传朱亥名，行人尚识夷门道。\n白璧黄金万户侯，宝刀骏马填山丘。\n年代凄凉不可问，往来唯有水东流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10437.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10437","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}